I go into the supermarket.
I take a shopping basket.
The basket is still empty.
My cupboards at home are empty too.
I need many groceries today.
I look for the dairy products.
I want cheese.
I see a large piece of Emmentaler.
I like Emmentaler very much.
I put the cheese into the basket.
I also need rice.
I look for the rice.
The rice goes into the basket too.
I also want pasta.
I take the pasta.
And I have no coffee left.
A morning without coffee is not good.
I put the coffee into the basket.
The shopping basket is heavy now.
